            "question": "Clinical Esthetician:",
            "answer": "<p>For the Clinical Esthetician performing advanced corrective facial protocols, the Modular Column provides a centralized hub that eliminates the need for redundant side-tables. By housing integrated steamers, vacuum units, and magnifying lamps on a single, stabilized vertical mount, the practitioner gains precious floor space, allowing for fluid movement around the treatment bed and reduced cross-contamination risk during complex service sequences.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_74hYTC": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Clinical Spa Therapist:",
            "answer": "<p>For the Clinical Spa Therapist managing high-tech rejuvenation suites, the column offers unmatched adaptability. The modular rail system allows for the rapid swapping of accessory holders as treatment technology evolves. Whether integrating new laser delivery systems or high-end diagnostic tools, the station ensures all handpieces and cables are managed securely, maintaining a clutter-free, professional environment that enhances client trust and procedural safety.</p>"
          }
        },
