          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Tattooist or Permanent Makeup Specialist:",
            "answer": "<p>For the Tattooist or Permanent Makeup Specialist requiring extreme technical precision, this system provides the ultimate ergonomic foundation. By elevating heavy power supplies and auxiliary lighting to the exact required eye level, the practitioner effectively mitigates visual fatigue and maintains a consistent, stable posture throughout lengthy sessions. This optimized configuration ensures that every stroke is delivered with absolute steadiness, regardless of the procedure's duration.</p>"
          }
        }
